    <section class="resume-section">
      <h2>Profile</h2>
      <div>
        <p class="resume-intro">Communication Network Engineering student at the University of Brasília, focused on information security, cyber defense, and infrastructure. Building hands-on experience in threat monitoring, access control, and observability, combining a defensive SOC perspective with CTF practice and offensive-security studies.</p>
        <p>Currently working as an IT Infrastructure Intern at Associação GigaCandanga, Teaching Assistant in Advanced Topics in Computers, and part of the management team at UnBreakable, UnB's offensive-security study group.</p>
      </div>
