            <li>Researched public threat intelligence (IOC) feeds as input for future integration with detection tools.</li>
            <li>Developed the project's technical glossary, covering threat concepts, monitoring tools (SIEM/IDS/IPS/SOAR), network protocols, and multi-tenant architecture.</li>
          </ul>
